                <td valign="top" class="row2"> <span class="smalltext"><b>Where's a 51 enchanter?</b></span>
                  <p><span class="largetext">Hello everybody, I know that it says 55+ in the sticky but I figured it wouldn't hurt to try. I am a Human 51 Enchanter. I'm a friend of Maarkov's and I've grouped with a bit of you. Off the top of my head, Phisto, Bawd, Hawkmen, Shennandoah, Ephyx for a short amount of time, Mistyrain and I think that's about it. I did group with Maarkov but that was back at like level 20 in Mistmoore =P back when people actually went there. I was actually in Fates Defiance once for a bit of time. Then I left my alt in Fates Defiance and moved myself to Pale Riders. I deleted that alt. I'm on at least 3 hours a day and am in EST. I didn't take too much part in Pale Riders due to the fact that I was too low. 
<br />

<br />
I came back to the game about 2 to 3 months ago at level 47. I was deguilded...and Ive kinda been looking for a guild since. My first resort was actually you guys, but recruitment was completely closed. Then I looked at two other guilds deeply. One of Maarkov's friends, Tigermane, was in AoS. I was referred to them but when Tigermane left, I lost interest in them. I also applied to Amichi, but I haven't gotten much response from them. I've been looking at your boards a lot and at least weekly checking if recruitment was opened..it's safe to say I was obssesed =P.
<br />

<br />
I have a key to sebilis. I have one point in run speed. I am not sure what faction you guys are on, but I spent basically all of last week in Kael. I will come back to this post later on and edit it with a magelo link and anything else that might be helpful that I may think of.
<br />

